<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Social Media Privacy Toolkit</title>
    
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

</head>
<body>

    <h1>Social Media Privacy Toolkit</h1>

    <p>Welcome to our Digital Footprint Toolkit!</p>

    <h2>Protect Your Online Privacy</h2>

    <p>Learn how to stay safe on social media.</p>

    <h3>Privacy Tips</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>Use strong passwords.</li>
        <li>Keep your personal information private.</li>
        <li>Do not share your live location publicly.</li>
        <li>Enable two-factor authentication.</li>
        <li>Think before posting photos or comments.</li>
    </ul>
    
<hr>

<h2>My Privacy Checklist</h2>
<p>Select the privacy practices you follow.</p>

<form id="privacyForm">
    <label>
        <input type="checkbox" class="privacy-item">
        My social media accounts have suitable privacy settings.
    </label>

    <label>
        <input type="checkbox" class="privacy-item">
        I avoid sharing my live location publicly.
    </label>

    <label>
        <input type="checkbox" class="privacy-item">
        I use strong, unique passwords.
    </label>

    <label>
        <input type="checkbox" class="privacy-item">
        I have enabled two-factor authentication.
    </label>

    <label>
        <input type="checkbox" class="privacy-item">
        I review old posts and personal information.
    </label>

    <button type="submit">Calculate Privacy Score</button>
</form>

<h3 id="result">Your score will appear here.</h3>
<p id="advice"></p>

<hr>

<h2>Digital Footprint Assessment</h2>
<p>Answer these questions about your online habits.</p>

<form id="footprintForm">
    <label>
        Do you share personal information publicly?
        <select class="risk-item">
            <option value="0">No</option>
            <option value="2">Sometimes</option>
            <option value="3">Yes</option>
        </select>
    </label>

    <label>
        Do you post your live location publicly?
        <select class="risk-item">
            <option value="0">No</option>
            <option value="2">Sometimes</option>
            <option value="3">Yes</option>
        </select>
    </label>

    <label>
        Do you accept friend requests from strangers?
        <select class="risk-item">
            <option value="0">No</option>
            <option value="1">Sometimes</option>
            <option value="2">Yes</option>
        </select>
    </label>

    <label>
        Do you review your old posts?
        <select class="risk-item">
            <option value="0">Yes, regularly</option>
            <option value="1">Sometimes</option>
            <option value="2">Never</option>
        </select>
    </label>

    <button type="submit">Assess My Digital Footprint</button>
</form>

<h3 id="riskResult">Your assessment will appear here.</h3>
<ul id="recommendations"></ul>

<hr>

<h2>Social Media Privacy Guide</h2>
<p>Follow these tips to protect your digital identity.</p>

<div class="tips-container">
    <div class="tip-card">
        <h3>Instagram</h3>
        <p>Set your account to private and review tagged posts.</p>
        <a href="https://privacycenter.instagram.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Guide</a>
    </div>

    <div class="tip-card">
        <h3>Facebook</h3>
        <p>Review audience settings and control who sees your posts.</p>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/checkup/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Checkup</a>
    </div>

    <div class="tip-card">
        <h3>Google Account</h3>
        <p>Review security settings and connected applications.</p>
        <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/security-checkup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Security Checkup</a>
    </div>
</div>

<hr>

<h2>Online Safety Reminders</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Never share your password or OTP.</li>
    <li>Think before posting photos and comments.</li>
    <li>Check links before clicking them.</li>
    <li>Enable two-factor authentication.</li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h2>About This Project</h2>
<p>
    The Social Media Privacy and Digital Footprint Toolkit
    helps users understand online privacy risks and develop
    safer social media habits.
</p>

<h2>Project Objectives</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Improve awareness of online privacy.</li>
    <li>Assess digital footprint habits.</li>
    <li>Provide personalized educational recommendations.</li>
    <li>Promote safe and responsible social media use.</li>
</ul>

<h2>How It Works</h2>
<ol>
    <li>Open the privacy toolkit.</li>
    <li>Complete the privacy checklist.</li>
    <li>Answer the digital footprint questions.</li>
    <li>View the risk score and recommendations.</li>
    <li>Follow the privacy guides to improve online safety.</li>
</ol>


<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>


</body>
</html>
